### All events (start the app with the dev profile first)
GET http://localhost:8080/events

### One event
GET http://localhost:8080/events/rock-cluj

### Unknown event: 404 application/problem+json
GET http://localhost:8080/events/nope

### Book 2 seats: 201 with the booking
POST http://localhost:8080/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 2}

### Book more seats than are left: 409 application/problem+json with availableSeats
POST http://localhost:8080/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 1000}

### Invalid body (blank email, 0 seats): 400 application/problem+json
POST http://localhost:8080/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "", "seats": 0}

### One booking (replace the id with one returned by the booking request)
GET http://localhost:8080/events/rock-cluj/bookings/replace-with-booking-id

### Upcoming events in a city
GET http://localhost:8080/events?city=cluj

### Top events by booked seats
GET http://localhost:8080/events/top?n=2

### Create an event: 201 with a Location header
POST http://localhost:8080/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronic Night",
  "venueName": "Form Space",
  "city": "Cluj",
  "startsAt": "2030-10-10T22:00:00",
  "capacity": 800
}
